3. PRODUCT CONTEXT (from the PRD)
HireNestOS connects Admin (HQ), Recruiter (HQ), Client, Vendor and Direct Candidate to one governed recruitment lifecycle:

Source / registration → resume upload → profile → potential match → direct application OR vendor submission → recruiter review → client review → interviews (with ratings) → offer → accepted / declined → onboarded

Two-way discovery is required:

Requirement → Candidates: from a requirement, see ranked eligible candidates with evidence.
Candidate → Requirements: from a candidate, see ranked relevant requirements with evidence.
New feature in this MVP: Vendor & Client Rating System (Section 8). Vendor performance is measured on submission timing (SLA), candidate quality and process compliance, kept as three separate scores. Clients give structured feedback after every interview round.

