4.2 Auth flows
Sign up (email + password, Supabase Auth): fields full name, email, password, and "I am a…" (Candidate / Vendor agency / Hiring company). For vendor or company, also ask for company name. Send it as options.data = { full_name, signup_intent: 'candidate' | 'vendor' | 'client', company_name }. The database decides the role. Candidates become candidate; everyone else becomes pending.
