  "overall": { "status": "ok|not_enough_data|weights_not_approved", "score": n|null,
               "weights": { "timing": 30, "quality": 50, "compliance": 20, "approved": false } }
}
Render every null / not_enough_data as "Not enough data" with the sample count. Never show 0 instead of null. Never compute scores in the browser.

